{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RCA refinement: cumulative pacing fixes repeated late wake-ups but cannot recover after libcurl has already aborted during one uninterrupted scheduling gap. Controlled pauses confirmed the configured low-speed window is the boundary, so the stable remedy splits fast zero-byte stall controls from one production-window dribble integration and tests pacing math deterministically."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786451800726104001,"uuid":"689d2d8a-07ad-45b1-8989-0660404c10e6"}